<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Feb consumer spending rises 1.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch Feb consumer spending rises 1.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch consumer spending rose 1.4 percent in volume terms in February compared with February 1996, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.  </p>
<p> DUTCH CONSUMER SPENDING	   Feb 1997     Jan 1997</p>
<p>yr-on-yr pct volume changes</p>
<p> Total consumer spending	    1.4	    4.5</p>
<p>  - food, beverages, tobacco     -2.0	    9.2</p>
<p>  - durable goods		     4.8	    6.2</p>
<p>  - other goods and services	1.3	    3.2</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
